> Jun  8 07:18:17 mongoloid /kernel: curproc    = 0xfffffe001177e780
> Jun  8 07:18:17 mongoloid /kernel: pid = 173, comm = ldconfig
> Jun  8 07:18:17 mongoloid /kernel:
> Jun  8 07:18:17 mongoloid /kernel: panic: trap
>
> EEM

Did you rebuild your kernel with buildkernel / installkernel?  I believe that 
buildworld on 4.x still builds and installs new modules into /modules 
including the linux and osf1 compat modules.  New modules aren't guaranteed 
to work on older kernels, so if your kernel is still 4.9, that is probably 
your problem.

