RRD45 is quite an old 4x drive.  Do you use CDR or CDRW media?
Dark colored CDRs gave me problems on RRD45.  

Mind you, difficult to diagnose this remotely.

> >>> set boot_dev DKA500
> boot_dev protected from attempted operation

hmmmm..

set bootdef_dev DKA500

(IIRC)

