> by the DEC. (won't close and stay there.) There are no external

Probably the RRD45 is fscked beyond repair.  I had at least 2 go
to the CD graveyard this way.

You could try a boot from floppy, the floppy images are on the CD, and
then mount the CD via NFS for further installation.

